      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 221]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(At School)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I am often late for school because I sleep in late,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and my mornings are very busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I usually walk to school."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It takes about fifteen minutes to get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When class starts at 9:00,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "our teacher checks our homework and our journals."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When I don’t do my homework, I get very nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Like most other students, my favorite subject is P.E."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Our class has a lot of smart students in it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so we are very competitive."
    },
